                {"stepNumber":5,"title":"Debi Boron, Sindoor Khela & Bijoya / Dasara Blessings","body":"Offer betel leaf, Sindoor, and Sandesh to Maa Durga before immersion (Debi Boron), touch the feet of elders for Bijoya/Dasara blessings, and share Jalebi-Fafda, Payesh, or Puran Poli.","durationMinutes":20}
